IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tcta-types`
IMPORT `tcta-rules`
IMPORT `tcta-goal`

-- Taxation (Cross-border Trade) Act 2018 (UK) — the encoder's tests.
-- Expected values are worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN pr IS A `Procedure`, entitled IS A BOOLEAN, breach IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Goods facts`
`goods declared for` pr `, entitled` entitled `, breach` breach MEANS
    `Goods facts` OF FALSE, pr, entitled, Date 1 3 2026, JUST (Date 2 3 2026), breach, NOTHING

§§ `Goal 1 — liability`

#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `free-circulation procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 2 3 2026, `the applicable rate`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`Goods facts` OF TRUE, `free-circulation procedure`, TRUE, Date 1 3 2026, JUST (Date 2 3 2026), NOTHING, NOTHING) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `storage procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `transit procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` (JUST (Date 10 4 2026))) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 10 4 2026, `the applicable rate`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `inward processing procedure` `, entitled` FALSE `, breach` NOTHING) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 1 3 2026, `the applicable rate`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `authorised use procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 2 3 2026, `the reduced rate for the procedure`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `temporary admission procedure` `, entitled` FALSE `, breach` NOTHING) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 2 3 2026, `the applicable rate`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`goods declared for` `authorised use procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` (JUST (Date 1 6 2026))) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 2 3 2026, `the reduced rate for the procedure`), (`Liability` OF Date 1 6 2026, `the normal rate, less any earlier liability`)
#ASSERT `the import duty liabilities for` (`Goods facts` OF FALSE, `not presented or not declared`, FALSE, Date 1 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST (Date 5 3 2026)) EQUALS LIST (`Liability` OF Date 5 3 2026, `the applicable rate`)

§§ `Goal 2 — persons liable`

people MEANS LIST (`Person` OF "Declarant", TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE), (`Person` OF "Haulier", FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE), (`Person` OF "Owner", FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE), (`Person` OF "Agent", FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE), (`Person` OF "Bystander", FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the persons liable for` (`goods declared for` `free-circulation procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING) `among` people EQUALS LIST "Declarant", "Owner", "Agent"
#ASSERT `the persons liable for` (`Goods facts` OF FALSE, `not presented or not declared`, FALSE, Date 1 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST (Date 5 3 2026)) `among` people EQUALS LIST "Haulier", "Owner", "Agent"

§§ `Goal 3 — amount and notification`

GIVEN offence IS A BOOLEAN, notified IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Duty facts`
`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` offence `, notified` notified MEANS
    `Duty facts` OF 12, 10000, offence, notified

#ASSERT `the import duty for` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` NOTHING) EQUALS 1200
#ASSERT `the last day to notify a liability incurred on` (Date 2 3 2026) `with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` NOTHING) EQUALS Date 1 3 2029
#ASSERT `the last day to notify a liability incurred on` (Date 2 3 2026) `with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` TRUE `, notified` NOTHING) EQUALS Date 1 3 2046
#ASSERT `the last day to notify a liability incurred on` (Date 29 2 2024) `with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` NOTHING) EQUALS Date 28 2 2027
#ASSERT `a liability incurred on` (Date 2 3 2026) `is enforceable with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` (JUST (Date 1 3 2029)))
#ASSERT NOT (`a liability incurred on` (Date 2 3 2026) `is enforceable with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` (JUST (Date 2 3 2029))))
#ASSERT NOT (`a liability incurred on` (Date 2 3 2026) `is enforceable with` (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` NOTHING))

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the import position for` (`Import case` OF (`goods declared for` `free-circulation procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING), people, (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` (JUST (Date 10 3 2026))))
#ASSERT pos's `import duty at the applicable rate` EQUALS 1200
#ASSERT pos's `last day to notify the first liability` EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2029)
#ASSERT pos's `first liability enforceable` EQUALS JUST TRUE
none MEANS `the import position for` (`Import case` OF (`goods declared for` `storage procedure` `, entitled` TRUE `, breach` NOTHING), people, (`duty at 12% on £10,000, offence` FALSE `, notified` NOTHING))
#ASSERT none's `import duty at the applicable rate` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT none's `last day to notify the first liability` EQUALS NOTHING
